# The web image builds from the repo root (the pnpm workspace is the unit of
# install), so everything not needed for that build is excluded — copying host
# node_modules in would both bloat the context and shadow the container's own
# platform-specific installs.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-types
**/.turbo
**/.output
**/.wxt
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
.git
.github
py
